# Take the WebSocket on /screen, and subscribe to the CLOSE event so the stack
# runs again when the human disconnects (to restart the pony harness). A real
# deployment gates this upgrade (a session cookie, an Origin allowlist); this
# example keeps it open so it runs with nothing configured.
WHEN @websocket.upgrade == true && @web.req.url.path == "/screen"
  EXEC "txco://websocket/accept"
    WITH events = ["close"]
